\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 It's important to distinguish between pieces driven by opinion, speculation or fact, and "absolutely important" that these sources of information have a process for verifying information. And it's even better if you can seek out some of these sources yourself, rather than only letting a social media algorithm feed you all your information.}
